 "verdict_original": "related-not-frontrun",
 "headline_text": "Yoink was the first to exploit MintSwap's vMINT/ETH sell-path pricing bug (swapExactTokensForETH used getAmountIn): 6 pool txs in 6 blocks, about 101.8 ETH net after 110.8 ETH of builder bribes; it returned 91.62 ETH to the LP, keeping a 10% bounty.",
