   "headline": false
  },
  "verdict_reason": "The txs the MintSwap team calls the hack are Yoink's own (index 0 of blocks 19563164/65); the pool's full transfer history shows Yoink's tx is the first sell-path call ever, so there is no attacker tx to beat or replay. The only third-party tx it pre-empted is an innocent user's pending 5,991 vMINT sell (public mempool 9.4 s earlier, reverted afterwards), which Yoink's different-shaped call does not replay; whether it triggered the bot is unproven. A second searcher made two small sells (0.78 ETH) only after Yoink.",
